imes upon invoking \"Reimport\" on certain external scene resources whose original formats support animations ( and likely specifically after the scene has already been instantiated as a child under another scene's root node ), the following error log message may appear:\r\n\r\n```\r\nInvalid animation name: 'my_animation_library_name/my_animation_name'.\r\n```\r\n\r\nSuch an occurrence is due to how the `AnimationMixer::get_animation_list` method is implemented to return registered animation names with a prefix of the name of the owning animation library if it is not the default library which is nameless ( https://github.com/PierceLBrooks/godot/blob/plb/import-scene-res-anim-name-replacement-bug/scene/animation/animation_mixer.cpp#L146 ).\r\n\r\nMy changes will resolve this issue.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"h